    "long_instructions": "Use PAIR Programming with AI to  help manage your postings:\r\n\r\n* **Prompt:** Ask AI to generate or explain a helper.\r\n\r\n* **Analyze:** Compare two possible versions or lines of code.\r\n\r\n* **Integrate:** Implement and test in the display.\r\n\r\n* **Reflect:** Write a short statement about how helper functions protect data consistency in *reflection.md*\r\n\r\n---\r\n### ☁️ Humidity Spike!\r\n**Status:** Urgent Update\r\n\r\n\r\n**Details:** The humidity just hit 90%! Your followers need help *today*. You need to post an emergency \"Anti-Frizz Tip\" in the first slot (Monday).\r\n\r\n**Action Required:** Add this post to the very **start** of your feed using *unshift()*. This will bump all other posts to the next day.\r\n\r\n* **Title:** \"Anti-Frizz Tip\"\r\n* **Content:** \"Use a silk scarf to save your hair!\"\r\n* **Image:** \"frizz.jpg\"\r\n",
